ORG 100

/ ==========================================
/ ETAPA 1: ENTRADA DE DADOS
/ ==========================================
Input,      Input
Store Op        / 1 = Soma, 2 = Sub, 3 = Mul, 4 = Div
Input
Store N1
Input
Store N2

/ ==========================================
/ ETAPA 2: ESCOLHA DA OPERACAO
/ ==========================================
Load Op
Subt C1
Skipcond 400
Jump CheckSub
Jump DoAdd

CheckSub,   Load Op
Subt C2
Skipcond 400
Jump CheckMul
Jump DoSub

CheckMul,   Load Op
Subt C3
Skipcond 400
Jump CheckDiv
Jump DoMul

CheckDiv,   Load Op
Subt C4
Skipcond 400
Jump Error
Jump DoDiv

/ ==========================================
/ ETAPA 3: CALCULO MATEMATICO
/ ==========================================
DoAdd,      Load N1
Add N2
Jump SalvaRes

DoSub,      Load N1
Subt N2
Skipcond 000
Jump SalvaRes
Jump Error

/ MUL = N1 * N2 (somas repetidas)
DoMul,      Load N2
Skipcond 000       / se N2 < 0 -> erro
Jump MulInit
Jump Error

MulInit,    Clear
Store RES
Load N2
Store Counter

MulLoop,    Load Counter
Subt C0
Skipcond 400       / se Counter == 0
Jump MulDo
Jump SalvaResFromRes

MulDo,      Load RES
Add N1
Store RES
Load Counter
Subt C1
Store Counter
Jump MulLoop

SalvaResFromRes, Load RES
Jump SalvaRes

/ DIV = N1 / N2 (subtracoes repetidas, inteiro)
DoDiv,      Load N2
Skipcond 400       / se N2 == 0 -> erro
Jump DivCheckPos
Jump Error

DivCheckPos, Load N2
Skipcond 800      / se N2 > 0 segue
Jump Error
Jump DivInit

DivInit,    Load N1
Skipcond 000       / N1 < 0 erro
Jump DivStart
Jump Error

DivStart,   Clear
Store RES          / quociente
Load N1
Store DivTemp

DivLoop,    Load DivTemp
Subt N2
Skipcond 000   / se negativo → para
Jump DivEnd
Store DivTemp
Load RES
Add C1
Store RES
Jump DivLoop

DivEnd,     Jump SalvaResFromRes

SalvaRes,   Store RES
Load RES
Subt C100
Skipcond 000
Jump Error
Jump CalcDigits

/ ==========================================
/ ETAPA 4: SEPARAR DEZENAS E UNIDADES
/ ==========================================
CalcDigits, Load RES
Store TempUnits
Clear
Store TempTens

Div10,      Load TempUnits
Subt C10
Skipcond 000
Jump Sub10
Jump RenderTens

Sub10,      Store TempUnits
Load TempTens
Add C1
Store TempTens
Jump Div10

/ ==========================================
/ ETAPA 5: SELECAO NUMERICA - DEZENAS
/ ==========================================
RenderTens, Load TempTens
Skipcond 400   / se == 0
Jump T_Check1  / se NÃO for 0 → desenha
Jump RenderUnits  / se for 0 → pula

T_Check1,   Load TempTens
Subt C1
Skipcond 400
Jump T_Check2
Jump T_Draw1

T_Check2,   Load TempTens
Subt C2
Skipcond 400
Jump T_Check3
Jump T_Draw2

T_Check3,   Load TempTens
Subt C3
Skipcond 400
Jump T_Check4
Jump T_Draw3

T_Check4,   Load TempTens
Subt C4
Skipcond 400
Jump T_Check5
Jump T_Draw4

T_Check5,   Load TempTens
Subt C5
Skipcond 400
Jump T_Check6
Jump T_Draw5

T_Check6,   Load TempTens
Subt C6
Skipcond 400
Jump T_Check7
Jump T_Draw6

T_Check7,   Load TempTens
Subt C7
Skipcond 400
Jump T_Check8
Jump T_Draw7

T_Check8,   Load TempTens
Subt C8
Skipcond 400
Jump T_Check9
Jump T_Draw8

T_Check9,   Load TempTens
Subt C9
Skipcond 400
Jump Error
Jump T_Draw9

/ ==========================================
/ ETAPA 6: SELECAO NUMERICA - UNIDADES
/ ==========================================
RenderUnits, Load TempUnits
Subt C0
Skipcond 400
Jump U_Check1
Jump U_Draw0

U_Check1,   Load TempUnits
Subt C1
Skipcond 400
Jump U_Check2
Jump U_Draw1

U_Check2,   Load TempUnits
Subt C2
Skipcond 400
Jump U_Check3
Jump U_Draw2

U_Check3,   Load TempUnits
Subt C3
Skipcond 400
Jump U_Check4
Jump U_Draw3

U_Check4,   Load TempUnits
Subt C4
Skipcond 400
Jump U_Check5
Jump U_Draw4

U_Check5,   Load TempUnits
Subt C5
Skipcond 400
Jump U_Check6
Jump U_Draw5

U_Check6,   Load TempUnits
Subt C6
Skipcond 400
Jump U_Check7
Jump U_Draw6

U_Check7,   Load TempUnits
Subt C7
Skipcond 400
Jump U_Check8
Jump U_Draw7

U_Check8,   Load TempUnits
Subt C8
Skipcond 400
Jump U_Check9
Jump U_Draw8

U_Check9,   Load TempUnits
Subt C9
Skipcond 400
Jump Error
Jump U_Draw9

/ ==========================================
/ ETAPA 7: DESENHAR DEZENAS
/ ==========================================
T_Draw1,    Load Cor
StoreI T22
StoreI T32
StoreI T42
StoreI T52
StoreI T62
Jump RenderUnits

T_Draw2,    Load Cor
StoreI T21
StoreI T22
StoreI T23
StoreI T33
StoreI T41
StoreI T42
StoreI T43
StoreI T51
StoreI T61
StoreI T62
StoreI T63
Jump RenderUnits

T_Draw3,    Load Cor
StoreI T21
StoreI T22
StoreI T23
StoreI T33
StoreI T42
StoreI T43
StoreI T53
StoreI T61
StoreI T62
StoreI T63
Jump RenderUnits

